; A currency's inferred_tolerance_default counts in a transaction that
; names the currency. The sale names none: its cost is {} and its cash
; posting is left out, so the interpolated number is not rounded to the
; 0.1 USD the default implies.
option "inferred_tolerance_default" "USD:0.05"

2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Proceeds

2020-01-02 * "Buy"
  Assets:Stock   3 HOOL {33.333 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -99.999 USD

2020-01-03 * "Sell"
  Assets:Stock  -1 HOOL {}
  Assets:Proceeds

2020-01-04 balance Assets:Proceeds  33.333 USD
